-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",240,{
[7649]="700156FD\n1\tTalk to Cottar Tunnelly, the Weaponsmith's Guild-leader\tCottar Tunnelly, the Weaponsmith's Guild-leader is in the Guild-hall in Thorin's Hall. The Master of Crafting Guilds has instructed you to speak with Cottar Tunnelly to learn more about the Weaponsmith's Guild.\n2\tTalk to the emblem recipe vendor\tHatheldir is in the Weaponsmith's Guild-hall in Thorin's Hall. Cottar Tunnelly has directed you to speak with Hatheldir to look at what recipes he sells.\n3\tTalk to the vendor who sells improved recipes\tBill Mossman is in the Weaponsmith's Guild-hall in Thorin's Hall. Cottar Tunnelly has directed you to speak with Bill Mossman to look at what recipes he sells.\n",
[7650]="7003F1D6\n1\tSpeak with Éowyn in Dunharrow to learn of West Gondor\tÉowyn can be found in Dunharrow. You should speak with Éowyn upon your arrival in Dunharrow.\n2\tSpeak with Éowyn in Dunharrow to learn of West Gondor\tÉowyn can be found in Dunharrow. You should speak with Éowyn upon your arrival in Dunharrow.\n",
[7651]="700156FC\n1\tTalk to Viola Brockhouse, the Woodworker's Guild-leader\tViola Brockhouse, the Woodworker's Guild-leader is in the guild hall in Esteldín. The Master of Crafting Guilds has instructed you to speak with Viola Brockhouse to learn more about the Woodworker's Guild.\n2\tTalk to the carving recipe vendor\tGuthki is in the Woodworker's Guild-hall in Esteldín. Viola Brockhouse has directed you to speak with Guthki to look at what recipes he sells.\n3\tTalk to the vendor who sells improved recipes\tTawarbes is in the Woodworker's Guild-hall in Esteldín. Viola Brockhouse has directed you to speak with Tawarbes to look at what recipes she sells.\n",
[7652]="70015E27\n1\tTalk to Lengliel at Echad Eregion\030Collect tattered White Hand banners (total: 12)\tTattered White Hand Banners can be found throughout the ruins of Barad Morlas, south-west of Echad Eregion. Lengliel is at Echad Eregion, north-east of Barad Morlas. Lengliel has asked you to help her determine the identity of the half-orcs' leader by collecting banners from the ruins of Barad Morlas.\n",
[7653]="70061771\n1\tDefeat goblins at Lhúngobel (total: 12)\tGoblins can be found at Lhúngobel in Yondershire. While exploring the Yondershire, you have encountered goblins at Lhúngobel. You should defeat goblins at Lhúngobel.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many goblins at Lhúngobel.\n",
[7654]="70046C28\n1\tDefeat Khundolar at Uya Hujûm (total: 12)\030Burn Khundolar banners (total: 8)\030Destroy Khundolar ration-barrels (total: 8)\030Destroy Khundolar trebuchets (total: 4)\tUya Hujûm can be found in north-eastern North Ithilien. Tordoron has asked you to assault the Khundolar encampment of Uya Hujûm.\n2\tTalk to Tordoron\tTordoron can be found in the northern wilds of North Ithilien. You have routed the Khundolar encamped in North Ithilien and should now report to Tordoron.\n3\tTalk to Anborn at Henneth Annûn\tAnborn can be found at Henneth Annûn. You have routed the Khundolar threat within North Ithilien and should now return to Anborn.\n",
[7655]="70015E28\n1\tDefeat half-orcs at Barad Morlas (total: 15)\tHalf-orcs can be found at Barad Morlas, south-west of Echad Eregion. Lengliel has asked you to go to Barad Morlas and thin the ranks of the half-orcs there.\n2\tTalk to Lengliel at Echad Eregion\tLengliel is at Echad Eregion, north-east of Barad Morlas. You should return to Lengliel and tell her that you have done as she asked.\n",
[7656]="7002C6E5\n1\tTalk to Idmar\tIdmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant. Doron bade you return to Idmar.\n",
[7657]="70040EC2\n1\tDefeat Corsairs in Edhellond (total: 12)\tCorsairs can be found throughout Edhellond in north-west Belfalas. You have encountered a large force of Corsairs occupying Edhellond. They must be defeated before they can bring more harm to the people of Gondor.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Corsairs in Edhellond.\n",
[7658]="70054676\n1\tDefeat great-bats (total: 10)\tGreat-bats from Agarnaith have invaded the third tier in Minas Morgul, the Circle of Madness. You should defeat great-bats.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[7659]="7006569C\n1\tDiscover Galdir's Dell\tFleeing from their defeat at the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, deadly Wargs have taken over Galdir's Dell. They must be driven out, lest they grow in number and threat.\n2\tDefeat Wargs at Galdir's Dell (total: 10)\tFleeing from their defeat at the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, deadly Wargs have taken over Galdir's Dell. They must be driven out, lest they grow in number and threat.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many Wargs at Galdir's Dell.\n",
[7660]="70019CCE\n1\tDefeat Anduin lizards (total: 10)\tAnduin lizards can mostly be found in Egladil in the south-east reaches of Lothlórien. Farasdúr has asked you to defeat several of the Anduin lizards that have encroached upon the hunting grounds of the Galadhrim.\n2\tTalk to Farasdúr near the Vinyards of Lórien\tFarasdúr is near the Vinyards of Lórien in Egladil. You should speak with Farasdúr near the Vinyards of Lórien.\n",
[7661]="7001CD13\n1\tTalk to Himeinior near Barad Angol\tThe path to south of Helethir leads to Barad Angol. Danfennas has asked you to travel to Barad Angol and speak with the scout Himeinior.\n",
[7662]="70054653\n1\tHelp Damrod in Barad Angarth with 'Twice the Threat'\030Help Damrod with 'The Enemy of my Enemy'\tDamrod has asked you to destabilize the Orc forces by completing several tasks in the western half of the Circle of Wrath. You should complete quests in Zhar Skator.\n2\tFind Dolenthol\tDolenthol can be found somewhere amongst the fortifications in Barad Angarth. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n3\tHelp Dolenthol with 'Word Among Ugrukhôr's Forces'\tDolenthol has asked you to venture further into Zhar Skator and learn more about Ugrukhôr's forces. You should help Dolenthol with 'Word Among Ugrukhôr's Forces'.\n4\tTalk to Dolenthol\tReturn to Dolenthol in Zhar Skator with a report of what you overheard from Ugrukhôr's forces.\n5\tHelp Dolenthol with 'Confronting Shakfut'\030Help Dolenthol with 'Spoil the Supplies'\tDolenthol has asked for assistance destabilizing Ugrukhôr's forces in the Circle of Wrath. You should help Dolenthol with 'Confronting Shakfut' and 'Spoil the Supplies'.\n6\tTalk to Dolenthol\tYou should return to Dolenthol and inform him of your progress.\n7\tTalk to Damrod\tDamrod is standing by in Barad Angarth, awaiting word on Ugrukhôr's forces. You should talk to Damrod.\n",
[7663]="700379B6\n1\tTalk to Elda\tElda is outside the Mead Hall of Woodhurst. Calin told you to return to the Mead Hall and tell Elda to let you in so that you can search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.\n2\tThe Mead Hall door must be unlocked before you can enter and investigate the bodies of the fallen assailants.\t\n3\tEnter the Mead Hall of Woodhurst\tThe bodies of the fallen assailants were left inside the Mead Hall. Calin asked you to search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.\n4\tThe bodies of the men who attacked the Mead Hall can be found throughout the hall. Calin asked you to search the bodies of the fallen assailants for evidence of their motives.\t\n5\tTalk to Calin\tCalin awaits your return in the farm-house in Woodhurst. You should return to Calin and let him know what you have found.\n",
[7664]="7003A674\n1\tSpeak with Calin\tAccompany Calin to the nearby tavern, where he has arranged to have a drink and catch up with Arnwi.\n2\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse. He needs to know what has occurred in the tavern.\n",
[7665]="7002176D\n1\tTalk to Opal Goodbody at the Party Tree in Hobbiton\tOpal Goodbody is at the Party Tree in Hobbiton. You should speak to Opal Goodbody, for she has invited you to partake in the events of the Lithe Festival.\n",
[7666]="70032E40\n1\tFind the location of the eagle egg upon Iorbar's Peak\tThe dangerous snow-covered paths twist up the mountain side in front of you. You have begun seeking the current location of the egg, stolen by the giant Helf from the eagles.\n2\tRescue the egg without it receiving any damage\tThe eagle egg awaits rescue at the summit of Iorbar's Peak. Helf still poses a great danger to the egg while it is in his possession. You must be careful not to allow it not to become cracked when he unleashes his anger.\n",
[7667]="70032E3E\n1\tAscend the mountain to the first gate\tThe dangerous snow covered paths twist up the mountain side in front of you. You have begun seeking the current location of the egg, stolen by the giant Helf from the eagles.\n2\tDefeat Guthfinn and his minions\tThe Dourhand leader, Guthfinn, prevents your passage beyond the next gate. Guthfinn has fooled the stone-giants into helping him stop your advance up the mountian trails.\n3\tAscend the mountain to enter Helf's home\tThe gate beyond the stone-giant structures has been opened, allowing you to continue along the trail. With Guthfinn defeated, and the stone-giant games ended, you are free to proceed along the path to Helf and the egg.\n4\tDefeat Helf and secure the great eagle egg\tHelf awaits your arrival upon the summit of Iorbar's peak. The gates have been opened to the summit at the end of the path. Helf is expecting you, and the eagle egg cannot be far away.\n",
[7668]="70032E3F\n1\tAscend the mountain to the first gate\tThe dangerous snow covered paths twist up the mountain side in front of you. You have begun seeking the current location of the egg, stolen by the giant Helf from the eagles.\n2\tDefeat Guthfinn and his minions\tThe Dourhand leader, Guthfinn, prevents your passage beyond the next gate. Guthfinn has fooled the stone-giants into helping him stop your advance up the mountian trails.\n3\tAscend the mountain to Helf's home\tThe gate beyond the stone-giant structures has been opened, allowing you to continue along the trail. With Guthfinn defeated, and the stone-giant games ended, you are free to proceed along the path to Helf and the egg.\n4\tDefeat Helf and secure the great eagle egg\tHelf awaits your arrival upon the summit of Iorbar's peak. The gates have been opened to the summit at the end of the path. Helf is expecting you, and the eagle egg cannot be far away.\n",
[7669]="7000AC54\n1\tDeliver the ore to Soldier Kafaaz at Lugazag\030Collect Unrefined Isendeep Ore (total: 5)\tIron ore can be found on the dwarves who fight for the Free People or from the Isendeep Mine to the north. Angmar's army is shoring up the defences at Lugazag. They intend to build a massive iron pot to heat oil with which to douse the Free Peoples who attempt to assail the tower.\n",
[7670]="7000AC55\n1\tDeliver the ore to Soldier Gozad at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect Unrefined Isendeep Ore (total: 5)\tIron ore can be found on the dwarves who fight for the Free Peoples or from the Isendeep Mine to the north. Angmar's army is shoring up the defences at Tírith Rhaw. Gozad intends to build a massive iron pot to heat oil with which to douse the Free Peoples who attempt to assail the tower.\n",
[7671]="7000AE30\n1\tDeliver the ore to Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr at Lugazag\030Collect unrefined ore (total: 5)\tIn the Isendeep, to the north in the central part of Arador's End, you will find iron ore. Sergeant-at-Arms Kolr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Lugazag from the Enemy. You have been tasked with collecting the iron he needs to forge the cauldron.\n",
[7672]="70071B2E\n1\tCollect birêt-kibur (total: 12)\tGôbezhir has asked you to keep an eye out while travelling through An Shêru for birêt-kibur, iron fallen from the sky. Birêt-kibur could be found anywhere in An Shêru.\n2\tReturn to Jiret-menêsh\tYou have collected plenty of birêt-kibur while travelling through An Shêru. You should return to Jiret-menêsh so you may give it to Gôbezhir.\n3\tBring the birêt-kibur to Gôbezhir Firmhand\tYou have collected plenty of birêt-kibur while travelling through An Shêru. You should speak to Gôbezhir and give him the ore for which he asked.\n",
[7673]="7004E48E\n1\tCollect chunks of ore from rust-pocked deposits (total: 10)\tRust-pocked deposits can be found throughout the Ironfold. You have discovered an unfamiliar deposit in the Iron Hills. You should mine the deposit and deliver the ore you collect to the Dwarves of Járnfast.\n2\tDeliver the chunks of rust-pocked ore to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast\tForeman Brumbur can be found among the ruined mines of Járnfast. You have gathered a substantial amount of crude ore and should now deliver it to Foreman Brumbur in Járnfast.\n",
[7674]="7000AE31\n1\tDeliver the unrefined ore to Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr at Tírith Rhaw\030Collect unrefined ore (total: 5)\tUnrefined ore can be found in the Isendeep to the north in Arador's End or on the goblins living in Grothum, north and east of Tírith Rhaw. Sergeant-at-Arms Haliggyr received orders to forge a great iron cauldron to fill with oil. This cauldron will be used to defend the walls of Tírith Rhaw from the Enemy. He has asked you to find the unrefined ore he needs to forge the cauldron.\n",
[7675]="70000C33\n1\tBring the Warg-paws to Grimdeal at Ost Guruth\030Collect scarred Warg-paws (total: 12)\tWargs stalk the stretches of land to the south and west of Ost Guruth, especially in the areas surrounding Ost Cyrn. Grimdeal has asked you to hunt the Wargs for their paws to prove to the Eglain that the fear they inspire can be overcome.\n",
[7676]="7000AE59\n1\tTalk to Tordúr at Glân Vraig\tGlân Vraig lay to the south-east of the Isendeep. Sergeant-at-Arms Herecyne is under orders to inform the Captain-General of the successful attack and acquisiton of the Isendeep. She has ordered you to make your way to the Free Peoples' encampment of Glân Vraig and tell the Captain-General of the success.\n",
[7677]="70035924\n1\tTalk to JWBarry\tBy completing this quest, you will receive all Isengard raid deeds for a high level character.\n",
[7678]="70030024\n1\tDefeat enemies within Iserngraf\tDefeat enemies within Iserngraf.\n2\tDefeat invaders in Iserngraf (total: 20)\tIserngraf is teeming with invading enemies. Reducing their numbers should make them less of a threat for the Rohirrim when they return to reclaim this mine.\n3\tTalk to Frithnoth\tHaving reduced the ranks of enemies within Iserngraf, return to Frithnoth and apprise him of your efforts.\n",
[7679]="70030026\n1\tFind uncommon ore within Iserngraf\tFind uncommon ore within Iserngraf.\n2\tBring the ore you collected to Frithnoth\030Collect uncommon ore (total: 8)\tUncommon ore can be found in the Iserngraf. You should collect uncommon ore and bring it to Frithnoth.\n",
[7680]="70030021\n1\tDefeat the leader of the invaders in Iserngraf\tGangfinda stands nearby. You should ride Gangfinda to Iserngraf.\n2\tTalk to Frithnoth\tYou should return to Frithnoth and inform him of your success within Iserngraf.\n",
})
